05:04:18.060 --> 05:04:24.080
Normally, the spiritual power that a human possesses clashes with the demonic power of a demon.

05:04:24.080 --> 05:04:27.890
However, in a half-demon, the two powers merge.

05:04:27.890 --> 05:04:29.760
It is this synergy of power.

05:04:30.060 --> 05:04:32.450
