you seek power, my son? The path I walk is the way of supreme conquest.

06:07:30.320 --> 06:07:33.260
and it is power that will reveal the way for me.

06:07:34.690 --> 06:07:36.610
Supreme Conquest.

06:07:37.740 --> 06:07:42.300
Tell me, Sushomaru, have you someone to protect?

06:07:44.350 --> 06:07:44.870
Protect?

06:07:45.400 --> 06:07:52.830
The answer is no.

06:07:53.630 --> 06:07:56.020
I, Sushomaru, have no need of such.

06:08:37.770 --> 06:08:42.620
She will birth a child fathered by a demon. There is no need for decorum.

06:08:42.620 --> 06:08:47.720
The birthing room is forbidden to men!

06:08:47.720 --> 06:08:48.600
Tokimaru!

06:09:08.830 --> 06:09:11.990
Why would I have any reason to waste my time protecting someone?

06:09:12.530 --> 06:09:13.050
Ridiculous.

06:09:13.760 --> 06:09:26.660
I must reconsider my love with Ryu Kosei and not yet healed.

06:09:26.940 --> 06:09:28.030
This is sheer madness.

06:09:28.190 --> 06:09:29.070
That doesn't matter.

06:09:29.370 --> 06:09:30.000
I cannot.

06:09:30.060 --> 06:09:31.980
afford to lose her. Please, my lord.

06:09:32.400 --> 06:09:34.150
Besides, I am not

06:09:34.150 --> 06:09:36.050
long for this world. Master!

06:09:40.980 --> 06:09:48.980
Night of a lunar eclipse.

06:09:49.930 --> 06:09:51.590
Excellent. It's a perfect time

06:09:51.590 --> 06:09:52.530
to slay a demon.

06:09:55.790 --> 06:09:59.380
Who is it?

06:10:00.000 --> 06:10:03.200
It is I, Takemaru of Setsuna.

06:10:03.200 --> 06:10:05.160
Takemaru...

06:10:05.160 --> 06:10:07.740
Oh, thank goodness you have arrived.

06:10:07.740 --> 06:10:12.980
You must gather the men standing guard outside and leave the grounds at once.

06:10:12.980 --> 06:10:18.150
Please do as I say. I fear there is no one who is strong enough to challenge him.

06:10:18.150 --> 06:10:24.150
My lady, I have long felt a deep connection with you, as I'm sure you are aware.

06:10:24.150 --> 06:10:29.830
Even though I realize full well that your heart has been captured by a demon.

06:10:44.520 --> 06:10:45.520
changed, my lady.
